## Key data engineering problems solved

- **Merging two independently-evolving source systems** (parent + child company) into one gold analytics table without breaking either pipeline
- **Idempotent full loads vs. incremental loads** -- `COPY INTO` staging pattern so re-running incremental jobs doesn't double-count orders
- **Schema drift / inconsistent formatting** across source files (mixed date formats, inconsistent text casing, non-numeric IDs)
- **File lifecycle management** -- moving processed landing files to an archive path so the next run only picks up new arrivals
- **Denormalization for BI** -- a single wide view instead of forcing the dashboard tool to join five tables

